# TypeORM

Follow `.agents/skills/type-orm/SKILL.md` (and its `references/`) when wiring TypeORM.

Hard rules:

- ORM config and entities stay under `infrastructure/` — never in `domain/`
- Repository **ports** stay in domain; TypeORM lives only in adapters
- Prefer `*.repository.adapter.ts` names (ORM-agnostic), not `typeorm-*.ts`
- Uncomment `TypeormPersistenceModule` in `bootstrap/app.module.ts` (or Hono composition) after driver + env are set; feature modules import `TypeOrmModule.forFeature([...])` when needed
- No `synchronize: true` in production — use migrations; avoid N+1 with joins/`relations` inside adapters

